  "description": "Hitto Tamaga living on his own after his father had gone missing, receives a Crash B-Daman, his first B-Daman, as his birthday present from his missing father.<br><br>\n“Crash your adversity!”<br><br>\nHolding this message from his father in his heart, Hitto makes up his mind to participate in B-Daman battle tournament called “B-1 Crash Cup.” Through the battles, Hitto encounters a lot of rivals and sometimes develops friendships with them.<br>\nAfter the tournament, he comes to know about a secret society of rascal B-ders who find reason for living only in crashing. What is their true purpose? And what secret is there behind Hitto’s B-Daman?<br>\nGo! Fight, Hitto! Crash the evils and grab your future in your own hand!<br><br>\n(Source: d-rights website)",
